# CLAUDE.md - Vault Charter

This file is loaded by Claude Code on every session inside this vault. Permanent rules only. Living content (current priorities, active projects) belongs in linked notes, not here.

Replace all `<ANGLE_BRACKET>` placeholders before you start using this file.

---

